      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOING BROKE (2) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 401m at this track two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at Gosford last start. Good form should continue. GLAMOUR (4) caught the eye with a fast early split and setting up a nose win at this track over 401m in 22.88. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expected to measure up again. SLEEK APOLLO (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (18.47) at this track behind Bugatti Rico in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. The form out of his last race has been franked. Leading chance. NAN SAID NO (7) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
